msgid "F407 物理存储与制造维护"
msgstr "F407 physical storage and manufacturing maintenance"

msgid "本页规定 F407VE/ZG 的普通运行和显式制造维护边界。实例、只读 face 与共享方法表的 关系见 [factory 图](../explanation/factory.md)；协议和存储所有权仍由真实 C provider 承担。主机模型、ARM 链接和物理 HIL 是独立证据，HIL 为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "This page defines ordinary-operation and explicit manufacturing-maintenance boundaries for F407VE/ZG. See the [factory diagram](../explanation/factory.md) for instances, readonly faces and shared method tables. Actual C providers retain protocol and storage ownership. Host models, ARM linking and physical HIL are separate evidence scopes; HIL remains `not_executed`."

msgid "主阵列和 OTP"
msgstr "Main array and OTP"

msgid "VE 物理主阵列为 512 KiB、8 个 sector，ZG 为 1 MiB、12 个 sector。前四块各为 16 KiB，第五块 64 KiB，余下各为 128 KiB。普通 `flash` face 暴露完整几何，以 2.7–3.6 V 假设执行 x32 编程；擦除必须精确对齐实际 sector，不隐含产品保留区、 认证、升级、回滚或恢复策略。F407 是单 bank，Flash 取指和中断可能在物理脉冲期间 停顿，有限 deadline 不建立中断响应或调用返回的时间上界。"
msgstr "VE has a physical 512 KiB main array with eight sectors; ZG has 1 MiB with twelve. The first four sectors are 16 KiB each, the fifth is 64 KiB and the rest are 128 KiB. The ordinary `flash` face exposes complete geometry and x32 programming under a declared 2.7–3.6 V assumption. Erase must exactly match actual sectors and implies no product reservations, authentication, update, rollback or recovery policy. F407 has one bank: Flash instruction fetches and interrupts may stall during physical pulses. A finite deadline does not bound interrupt response or function return time."

msgid "显式 `[flash.<id>] maintenance=true` 才生成可选维护 face；它与普通 face 使用同一 controller ID 和物理 owner。查询不执行任何维护动作，也不构成制造授权。测试授权 只准许软件模型执行，不能作为真实设备上不可逆动作的许可。"
msgstr "Only explicit `[flash.<id>] maintenance=true` emits the optional maintenance face. It shares the ordinary controller ID and physical owner. Lookup performs no maintenance and grants no manufacturing authorization. Test authorization permits software-model execution only and does not authorize irreversible actions on real devices."

msgid "OTP 数据区为 `0x1fff7800..0x1fff79ff`，16 块各 32 字节；紧接着的 16 个独立 锁字节只允许 `0xff` 或 `0x00`。数据编程只能清零位，完整范围、锁状态和所有 zero-to-one 错误在第一脉冲之前检查。锁定单块用 x8 写入精确锁字节，不能用 x32 写入连带锁定相邻块。OTP 无擦除，主阵列 mass erase 不清除 OTP。"
msgstr "OTP data occupies `0x1fff7800..0x1fff79ff`, sixteen 32-byte blocks. The next sixteen independent lock bytes accept only `0xff` or `0x00`. Programming clears bits only; the entire range, lock state and all zero-to-one errors are checked before the first pulse. A block is locked by an x8 write to its exact lock byte, never an x32 write that could lock adjacent blocks. OTP cannot be erased; main-array mass erase does not clear it."

msgid "Option Bytes 和保护"
msgstr "Option Bytes and protection"

msgid "完整目标 image 包括语义 RDP 级别、按物理密度限定的写保护 sector 集合，以及 BOR/USER 字段。BOR 值是硬件编码：0 为 level3、1 为 level2、2 为 level1、3 为 关闭。USER 明确选择硬件 watchdog、STOP reset 和 STANDBY reset，不推导产品策略。 F407 不提供 PCROP 或双 bank 选项；不能把其它 F4 型号的功能套用到这两个型号。"
msgstr "The complete target image includes semantic RDP level, write-protected sectors bounded by actual density, and BOR/USER fields. BOR uses hardware encodings: 0=level3, 1=level2, 2=level1 and 3=disabled. USER explicitly selects hardware watchdog, STOP reset and STANDBY reset without inferring product policy. F407 offers neither PCROP nor dual-bank options; features of other F4 parts do not apply to these two parts."

msgid "每次操作单独声明已确认的效果：OTP_PROGRAM、OTP_LOCK、OPTIONS、MASS_ERASE、 PERMANENT。缺失对应声明时，在解锁或第一脉冲之前拒绝。这些位只是调用者显式 承担效果的合同，不是认证方案。读取与修改必须由同一特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread 执行者串行推进，不能与普通 Flash、调试器或另一 HAL owner 并行操作。"
msgstr "Each operation separately acknowledges its effects: OTP_PROGRAM, OTP_LOCK, OPTIONS, MASS_ERASE and PERMANENT. Missing acknowledgements reject before unlock or the first pulse. These bits express caller responsibility for effects, not authentication. One privileged Thread executor with interrupts unmasked serializes reads and changes with ordinary Flash; debuggers and other HAL owners cannot operate concurrently."

msgid "RDP1 退回 RDP0 会擦除整个用户 Flash 和 backup SRAM。外部制造映像必须把完整 调用闭包、向量、常量、栈、状态以及返回目的地放在能独立存活的 RAM；本平台不把 普通运行映像悄悄重定位到 RAM，也不承诺擦除自身后仍可返回。RDP2 永久关闭调试、 RAM/system boot 及后续 option 修改，没有降级路径；该动作要求 PERMANENT 声明。"
msgstr "RDP1-to-RDP0 erases all user Flash and backup SRAM. An external manufacturing image must place its complete call closure, vectors, constants, stack, state and return destination in independently surviving RAM. The platform does not silently relocate a normal runtime image or promise to return after erasing itself. RDP2 permanently disables debugging, RAM/system boot and subsequent option changes. It cannot be downgraded and requires the PERMANENT acknowledgement."

msgid "物理脉冲启动后无法取消。超时可能已经产生永久效果，不回放、不回滚，也不自动 重启。软件完成后通过 snapshot 报告 `power_on_reset_required`；调用者负责真正 的 POR。该标记只描述当前软件会话内的写入，重新启动后的清零不是已完成 POR 的 硬件证据。特别是保护变更不能用普通软件复位来替代所需的 POR。"
msgstr "A physical pulse cannot be cancelled after it starts. Timeout may follow permanent effects; operations are not replayed, rolled back or automatically reset. A completed software operation reports `power_on_reset_required` in its snapshot; the caller performs the actual POR. This marker records writes in the current software session only. A cleared marker after restart is not hardware evidence of POR. Protection changes specifically cannot replace a required POR with an ordinary software reset."

msgid "首次错误和实际排空分别处理。必须观察脉冲结束、撤编程模式、清除完成源、排空 禁用的 Flash IRQ 并验证重新锁定；拒绝锁定或 IRQ 排空时保留同一 active owner， 普通 Flash 访问和 Platform 停止均不能回收它。没有隐藏后台任务或隐式恢复策略。"
msgstr "The first error and actual drain remain separate. The provider must observe pulse completion, withdraw programming mode, clear completion sources, drain the disabled Flash IRQ and prove relocking. Failed relock or IRQ drain retains the same active owner; ordinary Flash access and Platform stop cannot reclaim it. There is no hidden background worker or implicit recovery policy."

msgid "外部总线与介质"
msgstr "External buses and media"

msgid "现有 FSMC 的 NE3 SRAM、CPU 窗口、启动内存与 NE4 parallel16 合同见 [模块 README](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/fsmc_hal/README.md)。启动内存的永久 收条早于 Platform 运行，失败或停止均不能撤回承载全局对象的 bank、引脚和时钟。 CPU 窗口本身不授予 DMA、堆、外部栈或执行权限。NOR/NAND 的芯片命令、页操作和 板级时序必须由完整选中模式维护，不能由 async16 名称推导。"
msgstr "Existing FSMC NE3 SRAM, CPU windows, startup memory and NE4 parallel16 contracts are in the [module README](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/fsmc_hal/README.md). Permanent startup-memory ownership predates Platform. Failure or stop cannot withdraw a bank, pins or clock backing globals. A CPU window does not itself grant DMA, heap, external-stack or execution permission. NOR/NAND commands, page operations and Board timing belong to complete selected modes and cannot be inferred from the async16 name."

msgid "SDIO 的有限 IRQ/DMA、CRC、取消、排空及拔卡责任见 [SDIO 模块合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/sdio_hal/README.md)。所有介质发现均为 显式运行期动作；冷态启动和 factory 查询不替换卡片或运行产品文件系统。"
msgstr "The [SDIO module contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/sdio_hal/README.md) defines finite IRQ/DMA, CRC, cancellation, drain and card-removal responsibilities. Media discovery is always an explicit runtime operation. Cold start and factory lookup neither replace cards nor run a product filesystem."

msgid "失败后的 owner 可显式调用普通 Flash face 的 `nx_flash_port_recover()`；Platform close 也执行同一有限清理重试。BSY 未退出、外来 enabled/active vector 或外来模式 仍返回 BUSY；只有实际模式撤回、状态清除、IRQ 排空与重新锁定全部读回成立后才 释放责任。仅本 owner 尝试解锁的 Option Bytes 才重试 OPTLOCK，不改写外来 options， 不重新发出编程脉冲、不回滚或掩盖原失败，也不替代所需 POR。"
msgstr "After a failure the owner may explicitly call `nx_flash_port_recover()` through its ordinary Flash face; Platform close performs the same bounded cleanup retry. BUSY persists while BSY remains set, a foreign vector is enabled/active, or a foreign mode remains. Ownership is released only after actual mode withdrawal, status acknowledgement, IRQ drain and relocking have all been read back. Only Option Bytes this owner attempted to unlock are relocked through OPTLOCK; foreign options are preserved. Recovery never issues another program pulse, rolls back or hides the original failure, or replaces a required POR."

msgid "ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.9 限制无复位的连续 BOR 编程。本实现不保留额外启动历史， 因此修改 BOR 必须使用实际 AHB 分频 1 或 2；分频大于 2 在任何解锁之前拒绝。 BOR 不变的其他 options 维护不受此限制，平台不会自动修改系统时钟。"
msgstr "ES0182 Rev19 section 2.2.9 constrains consecutive BOR programming without reset. This implementation keeps no extra boot-history state, so a BOR change requires an actual AHB divider of 1 or 2; a divider greater than 2 rejects before any unlock. Other option maintenance with unchanged BOR remains permitted, and the platform never changes system clocks automatically."

msgid "RX 使用 PFCTRL，NDTR 在启用后从 `0xffff` 计数；TX 使用 DMA-controller flow 与 精确 word count，不依赖 LAST 限制源预取，也不要求未声明 padding。两方向的 DMA TC 都可能由 software disable 产生，不表示数据、CRC 或卡编程成功。RX 在 EN=0 后仍可能有 FIFO 到 RAM 的写入， 须等真实 TC、FIFO_EMPTY 与全部 IRQ／地址退出后才结清借用。TX 的 RAM 引用退出 后，FIFO 内部副本仍可能使冷态 owner、后续 arm 和 close 保持 BUSY；平台不自动 清副本、重发或复位共享 DMA2。上层系统恢复与普通 stop 是不同责任。"
msgstr "RX uses PFCTRL and counts NDTR down from `0xffff` after enable. TX uses DMA-controller flow and an exact word count, without relying on LAST to bound source prefetch or requiring undeclared padding. In either direction, software disable can produce DMA TC; it does not establish data, CRC or card-programming success. RX may still write FIFO contents to RAM after EN=0 and cannot return its borrow until actual TC, FIFO_EMPTY and every IRQ/address reference are withdrawn. After TX RAM references end, internal FIFO copies can still keep the cold owner, subsequent arm and close BUSY. The platform does not automatically discard copies, replay them or reset shared DMA2. System recovery and ordinary stop are different responsibilities."

msgid "memory 单块使用 CMD17／24，2..max_blocks（上限 32）使用一次 CMD18／25 和 `N * 512` DLEN，保持 512 字节 packet；多块以 CMD12 和 CMD13 READY 收口，写入 还须实际编程 ready。命令可能生效后丢响应保留 repair 收条，不重放 payload。 CMD53 仍按 function unit 推进，不发 memory-only CMD12／13；完整 burst、16 字节 对齐和短 CMD53 DMA 拒绝保持不变。"
msgstr "Memory uses CMD17/24 for one block and one CMD18/25 with `N * 512` DLEN for 2..max_blocks, capped at 32, while keeping 512-byte packet geometry. Multiple blocks end with CMD12 and CMD13 READY; writes also require actual programming ready. A lost response after possible command effect retains a repair receipt without replaying payload. CMD53 remains function-unit-based and issues no memory-only CMD12/13. Full bursts, 16-byte alignment and rejection of short CMD53 DMA remain unchanged."

msgid "所选静态 ClockPlan 要求精确 PLL48=48 MHz，并联合满足 RM0090 的 PCLK2／ SDIO_CK 下界与 ES0182 的按宽度计算的严格 FIFO 约束。最小合法偶数分频使数据 不超过 12 MHz、识别／low-speed 严格低于 400 kHz；低 PCLK2 选择更慢时钟，非法 组合直接拒绝。只在无 host／DMA 借用时变更 CLKCR，控制间隔使用所选真实域的 生成常量与微秒量化余量；不提供运行期 DVFS 或高速协议切换。"
msgstr "The selected static ClockPlan requires exact PLL48=48 MHz and jointly satisfies the RM0090 PCLK2/SDIO_CK lower bound and the width-dependent strict FIFO constraint in ES0182. The smallest legal even divider limits data to 12 MHz and identification/low-speed operation to strictly below 400 kHz. Low PCLK2 selects a slower clock; illegal combinations are rejected. CLKCR changes require no host/DMA borrow. Control intervals use generated constants from selected clock domains plus microsecond quantization margin. Runtime DVFS and high-speed protocol switching are not provided."

msgid "`protocol=\"mmc\"` 可显式选择 1／4／8 位 legacy SDR，数据时钟最多 12 MHz。八位模式必须由 Board 授权完整十个 pad，按所选路线生成六或十份快照；SD memory 与 SDIO I/O functions 仍只接纳 1／4 位。MMC 在卡片 SWITCH 与 ready 检查成功后才提交主机宽度， 失败不隐式降宽。精确命令、错误位与引脚合同沿用上述 SDIO 模块说明； `tests/contracts/mmc8_assembly/` 是软件参考，不声明现有开发板 SD socket 已接八线。"
msgstr "`protocol=\"mmc\"` explicitly selects 1/4/8-bit legacy SDR with a data clock at most 12 MHz. Eight-bit mode requires Board authorization for all ten pads, generating six or ten snapshots for the selected route. SD memory and SDIO I/O functions still admit only 1/4-bit buses. MMC commits host width only after card SWITCH and ready checks succeed; failure does not silently narrow the bus. Exact commands, error bits and pin contracts follow the SDIO module documentation. `tests/contracts/mmc8_assembly/` is a software reference and does not assert that an existing development-board SD socket has eight wires."
